  "description": "<p>This customizable doormat offers a warm welcome to any home with its faith-based design. Featuring uplifting Bible verses and options for personalization, it serves as a meaningful accent piece. Crafted for both indoor and covered outdoor use, this doormat combines spiritual inspiration with everyday practicality.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalizable with family name, initial, or custom text.</li>\n<li>Features inspirational scripture-based designs.</li>\n<li>Soft and comfortable underfoot due to high-quality materials.</li>\n<li>Durable and suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor use.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with simple methods.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester fabric and memory stretch sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Gently soak up liquid with dry duster cloth, clean stain with water, use hand-held vacuum cleaner, sweep with broom, shake off outdoors, wipe with damp cloth and mild soap, or flush with garden hose.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This personalized doormat is ideal for entrances, front porches, or entryways, offering a welcoming touch to any home. It also serves as a thoughtful gift for housewarmings, weddings, baptisms, Easter, Christmas, or other special occasions.</p>",
